    "name": "Snail Mail",
    "steam_appid": 3669550,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/a269d0820734dfa98a9a9cf3cf639da8.avif?t=1751888683\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snail Mail is a competitive 2 or 4-player online card-based board game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/dc05839c163ed89da2af35d2113ad568.poster.avif?t=1751888683\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/dc05839c163ed89da2af35d2113ad568.webm?t=1751888683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/dc05839c163ed89da2af35d2113ad568.mp4?t=1751888683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a snail and bring your snailtopian town to glory by delivering THE letter to the other end FIRST.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/7d88d23d8e6fa0211f90d67fc919affe.avif?t=1751888683\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Call upon otherworldly allies by playing thematic, powerful cards that change the course of the game </strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/533eb6b6c70730caf982331ec5ea9f02.poster.avif?t=1751888683\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/533eb6b6c70730caf982331ec5ea9f02.webm?t=1751888683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/533eb6b6c70730caf982331ec5ea9f02.mp4?t=1751888683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You are not alone in this race! Your friends from other realities are ready to help you advance faster on the board or stall the enemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/35f3b8505540c16456d3496a866f2deb.avif?t=1751888683\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no slow crawl! You need a whole lot of strategy and a <i>little </i>bit of luck to win this chaotic game. Be on your toes as you navigate through the board because one big brain move can change the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/8347bf407a0b2d574cf9fee068702a58.poster.avif?t=1751888683\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/8347bf407a0b2d574cf9fee068702a58.webm?t=1751888683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/8347bf407a0b2d574cf9fee068702a58.mp4?t=1751888683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/5bc67a8d6769017dcd5fb3aef9e02651.avif?t=1751888683\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/53e5c6af730c0de6f51f2eeb0d838094.poster.avif?t=1751888683\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/53e5c6af730c0de6f51f2eeb0d838094.webm?t=1751888683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two games are the same! At the start of each match, you and your opponents choose from a variety of unique card packs\u2014mix and match to create powerful combos or pick the perfect pack to counter your opponents!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic 2 or 4 player online competitive card-based board game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose different thematic card packs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards to advance your snail or stall the opponent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose different map themes to set a different vibe</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/a269d0820734dfa98a9a9cf3cf639da8.avif?t=1751888683\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snail Mail is a competitive 2 or 4-player online card-based board game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/dc05839c163ed89da2af35d2113ad568.poster.avif?t=1751888683\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/dc05839c163ed89da2af35d2113ad568.webm?t=1751888683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/dc05839c163ed89da2af35d2113ad568.mp4?t=1751888683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a snail and bring your snailtopian town to glory by delivering THE letter to the other end FIRST.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/7d88d23d8e6fa0211f90d67fc919affe.avif?t=1751888683\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Call upon otherworldly allies by playing thematic, powerful cards that change the course of the game </strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/533eb6b6c70730caf982331ec5ea9f02.poster.avif?t=1751888683\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/533eb6b6c70730caf982331ec5ea9f02.webm?t=1751888683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/533eb6b6c70730caf982331ec5ea9f02.mp4?t=1751888683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You are not alone in this race! Your friends from other realities are ready to help you advance faster on the board or stall the enemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/35f3b8505540c16456d3496a866f2deb.avif?t=1751888683\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no slow crawl! You need a whole lot of strategy and a <i>little </i>bit of luck to win this chaotic game. Be on your toes as you navigate through the board because one big brain move can change the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/8347bf407a0b2d574cf9fee068702a58.poster.avif?t=1751888683\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/8347bf407a0b2d574cf9fee068702a58.webm?t=1751888683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/8347bf407a0b2d574cf9fee068702a58.mp4?t=1751888683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/5bc67a8d6769017dcd5fb3aef9e02651.avif?t=1751888683\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/53e5c6af730c0de6f51f2eeb0d838094.poster.avif?t=1751888683\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669550/extras/53e5c6af730c0de6f51f2eeb0d838094.webm?t=1751888683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two games are the same! At the start of each match, you and your opponents choose from a variety of unique card packs\u2014mix and match to create powerful combos or pick the perfect pack to counter your opponents!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic 2 or 4 player online competitive card-based board game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose different thematic card packs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards to advance your snail or stall the opponent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose different map themes to set a different vibe</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Race to deliver THE letter first in this strategic, card-based, online board game for 2 or 4 players \ud83d\udc0c Use powerful ability cards to speed ahead or sabotage rivals. Place blocks, lay traps &amp; think two steps ahead each turn. Bring in varied card packs for a fresh, chaotic challenge every game! \u2694\ufe0f",
